      "text": "​",
      "location": {
        "start": 164456,
        "end": 164471
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 164471,
        "end": 164472
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "⬥ The level 50 Wilderness Obelisk is located east of the Chaos Elemental, easily accessed with the Portable Obelisk , Obelisk Shards, or any of the other Wilderness Obelisks.",
      "location": {
        "start": 164472,
        "end": 164788
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 164788,
        "end": 164789
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• These options will teleport the player to a random Wilderness Obelisk unless they have the hard Wilderness area tasks completed.",
      "location": {
        "start": 164789,
        "end": 164933
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 164933,
        "end": 164934
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "text": "⬥ The teleport levers located in Edgeville  and Ardougne  teleport the player to the Deserted Keep, located west of the Chaos Elemental.",
      "location": {
        "start": 164934,
        "end": 165337
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "tag": "#text",
      "attrs": {},
